 "confidence": "high",
 "notes": "Single 22-way edge connector, rear view; the drawing names none, so it is called P1. Letters and numbers are opposite contacts, each labelled separately. LINE INPUTS #8 ... #1 on rows A/1, C/3, E/5, H/7, K/9, M/11, P/13, S/15 (same label on letter and number contact: read as balanced pairs, no +/- drawn, ports use 'a' letter / 'b' number); even rows between them are NC. CUE IN (T/16), LISTEN OUT (U/17) and TB IN (V/18) likewise pairs without polarity. Control lines: ASSIGN CTL (19), ON-AIR CTL (X), TALKBACK CTL (21); their direction is not drawn, recorded as control_in. CTL COMM (Z) recorded as ground (control common), GND (20), CHASSIS (22), +25V on Y. No -25 V is drawn. Legend NC = NOT CONNECTED. Title block: Ward-Beck Systems Ltd., size A, ISS. 1, DATE DEC 1977. No insert."
}